// title: Threat Intelligence Threat Types · Sentinel
// date: 2026-10-21
// product: Sentinel
// tables: ThreatIntelligenceIndicator
// purpose: The query can be used to visualize the different threat types you get from the MDTI connector to Sentinel. Some examples coult be botnet, phishing, MaliciousUrl or from a watchlist. This query can only be used in Sentinel.
// source: https://github.com/Bert-JanP/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/65d11700e1cb878403d87312acdd6b9a8dd622c1/Security%20Operations/Visualization%20-%20ThreatIntelligenceThreatTypes.md
// kind: repo
// author: Bert-Jan Pals
// license: BSD-3-Clause (as stated by the repository)
// archived by tools/kql_archive.py (CLAUDE.md 5l, 5eu)
ThreatIntelligenceIndicator
| summarize Total = count() by ThreatType
| render piechart with(title="Threat Intelligence Threat Types")
